        "Content": "Entrance Hall - (6.4m × 1.9m), Lino flooring, spot lighting, fire alarm\r\nKitchen - (4.0m × 3.1m), Lino flooring, waist & eye level cabinets, plumbed for dishwasher, electric hob with overheard extractor fan, tiled splashback, spot lighting & raised oven\r\nUtility room - (2.1m × 1.7m), Lino floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, ample storage, heating controls & rear garden access\r\nDining Room - (3.9m × 3.8m), Lino floor, sliding door to rear garden and exposed beams\r\nSitting Room - (4.2m × 3.8m), Lino floor, open fire with feature surround & spot lighting\r\nBedroom No. 1 - (3.6m × 3.8m), Laminate flooring & spot lighting\r\nMain Bathroom - (2.1m × 1.5m), Lino flooring, W/C, WHB, frosted window\r\nBedroom No.2 - (3.3m × 3.2m), Laminate flooring & spot lighting\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding - (2m × 2.5m), Timber floor, hatch to attic, hotpress with ample shelving\r\nMain Bedroom - (5.2m × 3.8m), Timber floor, spot lighting\r\nEn-Suite - (1.6m × 2.3m), Tiled floor, WC, WHB, frosted window, part tiled walls, electric shower\r\nBedroom No. 4 - (3m × 4.8m), Timber floor, spot lighting, eves storage\r\nMain Bathroom - (2m × 3.2m), Part tiled walls, electric triton shower, bath, velux window, WC, WHB, tiled floor\r\nOutside: Patio area, mature gardens, ample parking on front drive, gated entrance.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, mains water, shared septic tank between all eight houses in the development. €300.00 P/A for maintenance costs.\r\nBER: B Ber No: 109091033 Performance indicator: 149.36 Wh/m2/yr"
